{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>BUILD YOUR MEGASTORE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start with <strong>$400</strong>; choose a department from <strong>clothing, toys, bakery, sports, grocery, music</strong>, buy your first shelves and products, open for business, and grow.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819640/extras/069ddb4550ebf84bd02c19e2189379bc.poster.avif?t=1774009237\" width=600 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819640/extras/069ddb4550ebf84bd02c19e2189379bc.webm?t=1774009237\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819640/extras/069ddb4550ebf84bd02c19e2189379bc.mp4?t=1774009237\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>KEEP EVERY SHELF STOCKED</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Monitor all departments, refill shortages fast, and don\u2019t miss sales.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819640/extras/a2222be7145805e1dc3627fbe66d8538.poster.avif?t=1774009237\" width=600 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819640/extras/a2222be7145805e1dc3627fbe66d8538.webm?t=1774009237\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819640/extras/a2222be7145805e1dc3627fbe66d8538.mp4?t=1774009237\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>DEPARTMENT-SPECIFIC FEATURES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each department comes with its own mechanics. In the bakery, order dough, purchase an oven, and bake your products. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819640/extras/1d73b13f22f001b6b29ce989302e0631.poster.avif?t=1774009237\" width=600 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819640/extras/1d73b13f22f001b6b29ce989302e0631.webm?t=1774009237\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819640/extras/1d73b13f22f001b6b29ce989302e0631.mp4?t=1774009237\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>STOCK MANAGEMENT</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Track shelves in real time, top up any missing items, and unload trucks quickly with a hand truck.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819640/extras/f3b2b007215cba818dbb78db723a55d4.poster.avif?t=1774009237\" width=600 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819640/extras/f3b2b007215cba818dbb78db723a55d4.webm?t=1774009237\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819640/extras/f3b2b007215cba818dbb78db723a55d4.mp4?t=1774009237\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>GROW &amp; EXPAND</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expand your megastore in any direction by purchasing new sections.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819640/extras/3ffe606644ad3eb8da1eb95b3d289523.poster.avif?t=1774009237\" width=600 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819640/extras/3ffe606644ad3eb8da1eb95b3d289523.webm?t=1774009237\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819640/extras/3ffe606644ad3eb8da1eb95b3d289523.mp4?t=1774009237\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>OPEN THE SECOND FLOOR</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Open the upper floor to offer more space to your customers. Place departments wherever you like and make sure everything stays accessible.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819640/extras/1c60c485a153244b64208ec7ee3ff681.poster.avif?t=1774009237\" width=600 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819640/extras/1c60c485a153244b64208ec7ee3ff681.webm?t=1774009237\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819640/extras/1c60c485a153244b64208ec7ee3ff681.mp4?t=1774009237\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>MANAGE YOUR TEAM</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hire cashiers, stockers, bakers, and more; manage shifts and performance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819640/extras/8a62a642cf7aef13416d279b388fe579.poster.avif?t=1774009237\" width=600 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819640/extras/8a62a642cf7aef13416d279b388fe579.webm?t=1774009237\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819640/extras/8a62a642cf7aef13416d279b388fe579.mp4?t=1774009237\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>SERVICE ROOM &amp; WAREHOUSE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819640/extras/488abf7739726ed7b54a4ce48fae2098.poster.avif?t=1774009237\" width=600 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819640/extras/488abf7739726ed7b54a4ce48fae2098.webm?t=1774009237\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819640/extras/488abf7739726ed7b54a4ce48fae2098.mp4?t=1774009237\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A massive warehouse with 4 truck loading bays and access to both floors.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Buy warehouse equipment like a pallet robot, forklift, and pallet jack.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage the entire operation with stock control panels and warehouse displays.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keep items like computers and cleaning supplies in the service room to keep your store organized!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > <br><strong>AND MUCH MORE</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Attract more customers</strong> to your megastore with <strong>ads and product promotions</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bring your store to life with <strong>talking, reactive NPCs</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Boost satisfaction with a <strong>returns desk</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Buy <strong>recycling bins</strong> and <strong>turn empty boxes into cash</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Decorate your megastore</strong> the way you like with <strong>department-specific decorations and furniture</strong>: fitting rooms, various wall and floor customizations, a bakery <strong>tray rack</strong>, and much more.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Getting the Hang of It","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3819640/52df19f6c5953416652092dda97fe8ea86c3c6e4.jpg"},{"name":"Cashier on Duty","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3819640/52df19f6c5953416652092dda97fe8ea86c3c6e4.jpg"},{"name":"Checkout Machine","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3819640/52df19f6c5953416652092dda97fe8ea86c3c6e4.jpg"},{"name":"First Grand","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3819640/52df19f6c5953416652092dda97fe8ea86c3c6e4.jpg"},{"name":"Making Bank","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3819640/52df19f6c5953416652092dda97fe8ea86c3c6e4.jpg"},{"name":"Store Tycoon","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3819640/52df19f6c5953416652092dda97fe8ea86c3c6e4.jpg"},{"name":"Storage Unlocked","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3819640/52df19f6c5953416652092dda97fe8ea86c3c6e4.jpg"},{"name":"Dock & Roll","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3819640/52df19f6c5953416652092dda97fe8ea86c3c6e4.jpg"},{"name":"Warehouse Maxed Out","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3819640/52df19f6c5953416652092dda97fe8ea86c3c6e4.jpg"},{"name":"Forklift Rookie","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3819640/52df19f6c5953416652092dda97fe8ea86c3c6e4.jpg"}],"total":17},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3819640?t=1774009237","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819640/cd645f7cb00e67892fd8956148c8a5561dff7b33/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1774009237","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819640/001aec